<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE-OUT 1H '97 net profit up 58.6 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-OUT 1H '97 net profit up 58.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>	   (in million of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			 10.88   vs   6.86</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (cts)	  4.00   vs   4.00</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (cts)     17.58   vs  20.33 (restated)</p>
<p>    Total operating revenue	41.41   vs  36.56</p>
<p>    Investment and other income   0.96   vs   0.82</p>
<p>    Associates			  0.30   vs   0.29</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 16.05   vs  10.39</p>
<p>    Interest expense		  0.46   vs   nil</p>
<p>    Depreciation in fixed assets  0.71   vs   0.38</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		   14.88   vs  10.01</p>
<p>    Tax				   4.00   vs   3.15</p>
<p>Dividend pay  - September 12, 1997</p>
<p>Last day books close -  September 1, 1997</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Overseas Union Trust Ltd and is a unit of Overseas Union Bank Ltd.</p>
